      <marc:subfield code="a">Marianne Williamson has gained international prominence through her reflections on modern life. On this audio program, she discusses the psychological significance of eternal religious themes and delves into the workings of various spiritual traditions, noting their application to our personal quest for liberation and peace. The four parts of this set are: (1) Internal power/the balance of consciousness; (2) Creating the world/tough mind; (3) Undoing terrorism/rebirth-transformation; and (4) The living temple</marc:subfield>
